{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "おはようございます\nこんにちは\nこんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 菅原咲月（すがわらさつき）です🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobbsojTj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メリークリスマス🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年まだサンタになってないーーー🥲\n27日のミーグリでは何かしらになる予定なので、会える方はお楽しみに😚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobyQNNAv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サンタになってない2025年なので、、\nクリスマスマーケット行った時の📸\n帽子深すぎて、全然顔見えてる写真なかった😂😂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobLuotCZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "急遽、行く！と言ってお友達に着いていきました〜\n雨降ってきたりして、ちょっぴり悲しかったけどイルミネーションも綺麗だったしお腹いっぱい食べたし満足！！✌🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなに色んな場所のクリスマスマーケット行くの初めてでワクワクでした！🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、でもクリスマスディズニー行けなかったのちょっと悲しかった💧\n来年こそは！行く！絶対！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "表紙・巻頭を務めさせて頂きました雑誌が2冊発売になります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "12/26 発売\n「20±SWEET 2026 JANUARY」"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobFwZNeQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "12/27 発売　「B.L.T. 2月号」"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobE42hPT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またオフショットも載せますので楽しみにしててね〜✨\n是非お手に取っていただけると嬉しいです☺️\n感想もたくさん聞かせてね〜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "では、皆様良い一日を🎅🏻\nまた書きますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日の一曲。\n粉雪　/  レミオロメン"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2025.12.25"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "p.s."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日、16時30分からは\nテレビ朝日系「MUSIC STATION SUPER LIVE 2025」です！Ⓜ️\n是非、観てね〜👀"}], "source": "official"}